===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|annata|t=income of a year; income of half a year}}, from {{m|la|annus|t=year}}: compare {{cog|fr|annate|t=annats}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP|GA}} {{IPA|/æn/|lang=en}}
* {{a|Scotland}} {{IPA|/an/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|legal|Scotland}} A half year's [[stipend]], over and above what is owing for the [[incumbency]], due to a [[minister]]'s [[heir]]s after his [[decease]].

{{Webster 1913}}

